282","id":1874786068,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85vvvcU","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-03T02:46:48Z","updated_at":"2024-01-03T02:46:48Z","body":"@richardfontana - is there a Fedora issue related to this, by any chance?\r\n\r\n+1 to add this. I think this may be the first exception to MIT we've seen! At first I was thinking that it would be a new license as it's all together, but it is very explicit as to \"Optional exception to the license\" which seems to make `MIT WITH <name>` make sense\r\n\r\nPerhaps we use \"exception\" in the id to be consistent?\r\nmaybe `NoBinaryAttrib-exception` or the order @zvr had with -exception added??","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1874786068/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1874791993","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282#issuecomment-1874791993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282","id":1874791993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85vvw45","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-03T02:58:05Z","updated_at":"2024-01-03T02:58:05Z","body":"@jlovejoy, no, I just verified that the package is in Fedora after seeing this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1874791993/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1883638697","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282#issuecomment-1883638697","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282","id":1883638697,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85wRgup","user":{"login":"InSwiss","id":6169105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjkxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6169105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss","html_url":"https://github.com/InSwiss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/InSwiss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-09T19:17:45Z","updated_at":"2024-01-09T19:17:45Z","body":"+1 to add. We think it can be added as 'MIT WITH No Binary Attribution'  as it is being more permissive to an already permissive license we don't think word 'exception' is relevant.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1883638697/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1883655707","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282#issuecomment-1883655707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282","id":1883655707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85wRk4b","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-09T19:30:33Z","updated_at":"2024-01-09T19:30:33Z","body":"+1 to add. From a Google search I am seeing this exception showing up in many projects' / products' license notice disclosure lists.\r\n\r\nFor name and ID, we typically include the word \"exception\" if it is clearly an exception to an obligation. (See https://spdx.org/licenses/exceptions-index.html with many examples.) I would say that's the case here, since it gives a permission not to do something that would otherwise be required by the license.\r\n\r\nOften we have used the name of a project as the exception name, if there's a particular project that it's most notably tied to?\r\n\r\nMost of the instances where I'm seeing it used appear to be tied to this `fmt` library that @zvr originally filed this for, with a copyright date starting in 2012. E.g.:\r\n* https://ccache.dev/license.html\r\n* https://www.resolvebim.com/open-source-acknowledgements\r\n* https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-dl-designer/2021.1/CopyrightAndLicenses/index.html\r\n* https://learn.foundry.com/katana/dev-guide/Licenses/index.html\r\nas just a few examples.\r\n\r\nHowever, I do see one instance that is earlier: https://docs.oracle.com/en/database/oracle/developer-tools-for-vscode/21.7.1/licensing-guide/index.html shows this exception used for \"Jb Evain\" with a copyright date of 2006. Might be worth seeing if that seems to be the original source for this text?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1883655707/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1883708923","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282#issuecomment-1883708923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282","id":1883708923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85wRx37","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-09T20:10:03Z","updated_at":"2024-01-09T20:10:03Z","body":"Taking a bit of a closer look at the \"Jb Evain\" item: This appears to originate from [dotnet/runtime](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/main/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.TXT). And, digging into that particular file and the Git history, I think the \"Jb Evain\" notice actually got dropped into the middle of the \"fmt\" notice just above it -- accidentally cutting off the exception. All of which is to say, I think we can disregard that one.\r\n\r\nSo, the only place where I'm seeing this particular exception used is with the \"fmt\" library.\r\n\r\nGiven that, can we go with something like `fmt-exception` or `fmt-MIT-exception` for the ID, and \"fmt MIT Exception\" for the name?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1883708923/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1894915714","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282#issuecomment-1894915714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282","id":1894915714,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85w8h6C","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-17T04:23:46Z","updated_at":"2024-01-17T04:23:50Z","body":"# License Inclusion Decision\r\n\r\n## Decision:\r\n\r\n- [x] approved\r\n- [ ] not approved\r\n\r\n## Name\r\nfmt exception\r\n## License ID\r\nfmt-exception\r\n## XML markup\r\nnone\r\n## Notes:\r\nTypically used with MIT.\r\n## Next steps ##\r\nIf the license has been accepted, please follow [the accepted-license process to create the PR](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/request-new-license.md#accepted-license-process). \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1894915714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1894916169","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282#issuecomment-1894916169","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2282","id":1894916169,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85w8iBJ","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-17T04:24:26Z","updated_at":"2024-01-17T04:24:26Z","body":"@zvr - assuming you are ok with name and ID, do you want to make a PR for this?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1894916169/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]